(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE) Tj T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: PRADHAN MANTRI KISAN SAMMAN NIDHI \(PM-KISAN\)) Tj T*
T*
(1. OBJECTIVE & SCHEME OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(The Pradhan Mantri Kisan Samman Nidhi \(PM-KISAN\) is a Central Sector Scheme to provide income support to all landholding farmer families in the country to supplement their financial needs for procuring various inputs related to agriculture and allied activities as well as domestic needs.) Tj T*
T*
(2. FINANCIAL BENEFITS) Tj T*
(Under the Scheme, an income support of Rs. 6,000/- per year is provided to all eligible farmer families across the country in three equal installments of Rs. 2,000/- each, every four months. The amount is transferred directly into the bank accounts of the beneficiaries through Direct Benefit Transfer \(DBT\).) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
