(3. ELIGIBILITY CRITERIA) Tj T*
(All landholding farmer families, who have cultivable landholding in their names, are eligible to get benefits under the scheme.) Tj T*
T*
(4. EXCLUSION CATEGORIES) Tj T*
(The following categories of beneficiaries of higher economic status shall not be eligible:) Tj T*
(a\) All Institutional Landholders.) Tj T*
(b\) Former and present holders of constitutional posts.) Tj T*
(c\) Former and present Ministers, MPs, MLAs, MLCs, Mayors, and Chairpersons of District Panchayats.) Tj T*
(d\) All serving or retired officers and employees of Central/State Government Ministries and Departments.) Tj T*
(e\) All Persons who paid Income Tax in last assessment year.) Tj T*
(f\) Professionals like Doctors, Engineers, Lawyers, Chartered Accountants registered with professional bodies.) Tj T*
T*
(5. REQUIRED DOCUMENTS) Tj T*
(Citizens applying require: 1. Aadhaar Card \(mandatory\), 2. Proof of citizenship, 3. Land ownership papers \(Khatauni/Pattadar passbook\), 4. Bank account details linked with Aadhaar, and 5. Active mobile number.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
