(6. APPLICATION PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Farmers can apply through:) Tj T*
(a\) Official Portal: www.pmkisan.gov.in via 'New Farmer Registration'.) Tj T*
(b\) Common Service Centres \(CSC\) or Village Level MeeSeva / Grama Sachivalayam.) Tj T*
(c\) State Nodal Agriculture Officers designated by State Governments.) Tj T*
T*
(7. e-KYC MANDATORY REQUIREMENT) Tj T*
(Aadhaar-based OTP verification on PM-KISAN portal or biometric e-KYC at CSC centers is compulsory for the release of subsequent installments.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
